       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HELMHOLTZ-LOGIC.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HELMHOLTZ-LOGIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-UNIFORM-ATOMIC-EXCHANGE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ORDERED-LINEAR-TENSOR-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HELMHOLTZ-FREE-ENERGY-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-DISPATCH-LOCKLESS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIFORM-ORDERED-SEAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HELMHOLTZ-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HELMHOLTZ-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HELMHOLTZ-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EXCHANGE-AND-TENSOR.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-FREE-ENERGY-AND-DISPATCH.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HELMHOLTZ-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EXCHANGE-AND-TENSOR.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIFORM-ATOMIC-EXCHANGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ORDERED-LINEAR-TENSOR-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-FREE-ENERGY-AND-DISPATCH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HELMHOLTZ-FREE-ENERGY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-DISPATCH-LOCKLESS.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HELMHOLTZ-PROOFS.
           IF WS-UNIFORM-ATOMIC-EXCHANGE = 1 AND
              WS-ORDERED-LINEAR-TENSOR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HELMHOLTZ-FREE-ENERGY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-DISPATCH-LOCKLESS = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIFORM-ORDERED-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HELMHOLTZ-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HELMHOLTZ-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HELMHOLTZ-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HELMHOLTZ-CODE.
